('194', 'location', 'Thông tin địa điểm: Công viên Châu Á - Asia Park - Địa chỉ, khu vực, giờ mở cửa, giá vé và giới thiệu chi tiết', 'Địa điểm: Công viên Châu Á - Asia Park Công viên Châu Á - Asia Park là điểm tham quan và trải nghiệm nổi bật trong hành trình khám phá miền Trung. Công viên Châu Á - Asia Park là điểm đến phù hợp để kết hợp trong lịch trình khám phá Đà Nẵng, Hội An, Quảng Nam và thành phố Huế. Thời tiết, vé tham quan và giờ hoạt động nên được kiểm tra trước chuyến đi. Địa chỉ: 01 Phan Đăng Lưu, quận Hải Châu, Đà Nẵng Khu vực: Hải Châu Giá từ: 200.000 VND Giờ mở cửa: 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00; 15:00-22:00', '29', 'asia-park', '{"district": "Hải Châu", "price_max": 500000, "price_min": 200000, "avg_rating": 5, "category_id": 16, "review_count": 3}'::jsonb, '[-0.0143011,-0.0025173873,0.013322394,-0.0734306,-0.012804755,0.009389865,0.003118713,-0.014570639,-0.013890999,-0.015017851,0.007651455,0.005157405,-0.014909032,0.0066720513,0.112814136,-0.008385425,0.02700309,0.017019458,0.003508546,-0.0034234805,0.008982908,0.0034216081,0.020903304,-0.024201434,-0.005551703,0.0032679744,0.008229949,0.013134573,-0.0020424123,0.0095053725,-0.019191606,-0.020862523,0.017814482,-0.045153677,-0.007585307,-0.0029487151,0.028416578,0.01112627,-0.013721974,-0.010709696,-0.013574644,0.005877111,-0.010334489,0.00834041,-0.005201973,-0.03320392,-0.004804915,-0.04276511,-0.0005402487,0.01717217,0.028317748,-0.008738113,0.0035430747,-0.19612186,-0.011061051,0.0011910441,-0.020520756,-0.011531943,0.010534561,-0.010012255,-0.040890794,0.024879193,-0.037495762,-0.03002119,-0.014245309,-0.0004554918,0.018218404,0.030356593,0.0038307782,0.00874051,0.012498594,0.02115264,-0.01173453,-0.026935816,0.005892495,-0.008990113,-0.0055432143,0.007888668,0.008956157,0.018023342,-0.00970404,-0.023165628,0.0091476245,-0.0042193867,0.010049719,-0.000287765,0.0017636125,0.003636857,-0.020678809,0.010885651,-0.0071021863,0.01015425,-0.0010026052