('269', 'location', 'Thông tin địa điểm: Bãi biển Lăng Cô - Địa chỉ, khu vực, giờ mở cửa, giá vé và giới thiệu chi tiết', 'Địa điểm: Bãi biển Lăng Cô Bãi biển Lăng Cô là điểm tham quan và trải nghiệm nổi bật trong hành trình khám phá miền Trung. Bãi biển Lăng Cô là điểm đến phù hợp để kết hợp trong lịch trình khám phá Đà Nẵng, Hội An, Quảng Nam và thành phố Huế. Thời tiết, vé tham quan và giờ hoạt động nên được kiểm tra trước chuyến đi. Địa chỉ: Thị trấn Lăng Cô, huyện Phú Lộc, thành phố Huế Khu vực: Phú Lộc', '106', 'lang-co-beach', '{"district": "Phú Lộc", "price_max": null, "price_min": null, "avg_rating": 4, "category_id": 7, "review_count": 2}'::jsonb, '[-0.030518482,0.00666034,-0.0073698126,-0.06611111,-0.0073129493,0.003962593,0.0082089,-0.016425885,-0.008694491,-0.011102464,-0.0049434626,-0.00336824,-0.019703798,0.0023614208,0.112263605,-0.018671827,0.019123552,0.008281906,-0.002101265,-0.00462945,0.007686004,-0.0023420432,0.014970925,-0.0099279005,-0.013893365,0.0048636165,0.018409139,0.0040730056,0.009597411,-0.0047498452,-0.026453348,0.004702304,0.021659689,-0.0100416625,-0.028961403,0.0036580476,-0.005985406,0.00013251689,0.0018013094,0.00085722574,-0.015860053,0.00606177,-0.001754849,-0.0047731064,-0.0137282135,-0.023607813,-0.012496322,-0.039393887,-0.013997713,0.019181933,0.010570082,0.016292743,-0.005607632,-0.20631252,0.0057986667,0.017708892,-0.021968532,-0.0008044054,0.0027728553,-0.0151600065,-0.004484252,0.016450536,-0.036305197,-0.026627295,0.0023212233,0.004123895,0.012145537,0.02021185,-0.00055183395,0.0028515942,-0.0005608125,0.002765534,-0.014141639,-0.015326745,-0.019728033,0.008999903,-0.0108774,0.004127932,-0.015796263,0.011673212,-0.0053512943,-0.024868416,-0.0013569887,0.0028077043,0.018679576,-0.005781093,0.0027578701,0.0033999784,-0.019186052,0.020668438,-0.0133298235,0.018255778,0.002341181,-0.010285497,0.009302107,-0.0043568676,-0.012607656,0.0027349307,0.008386045,-0.0063245418,0.0032307662,0.002044695,-0.0038389664,0.017242806,0.