('398', 'policy', 'Chính sách hủy tour và hoàn tiền DanangTrip', 'Thời hạn và chính sách hoàn tiền khi hủy tour tại DanangTrip như sau: - Hủy trước ngày khởi hành từ 7 ngày trở lên: Hoàn trả 100% số tiền đã thanh toán. - Hủy trước ngày khởi hành từ 3 đến 6 ngày: Phí hủy là 50% tổng giá trị đơn hàng, hoàn trả 50% số tiền còn lại. - Hủy trong vòng 48 giờ trước ngày khởi hành hoặc vắng mặt vào ngày khởi hành: Phí hủy là 100% tổng giá trị đơn hàng, không áp dụng hoàn tiền. Đối với các tour vào ngày Lễ, Tết hoặc mùa cao điểm, quy định hoàn tiền chi tiết sẽ hiển thị cụ thể trên giao diện đặt tour. Khách hàng thực hiện hủy đơn tại mục Lịch sử đặt tour hoặc liên hệ bộ phận hỗ trợ chăm sóc khách hàng để được xử lý hoàn tiền chuyển khoản.', NULL, 'refund', '{"slug": "refund"}'::jsonb, '[-0.030546006,0.022608131,-0.0008331552,-0.06342467,-0.008608371,-0.0043609734,0.014164978,0.001642145,-0.006774205,-0.030746901,0.0008554349,0.022916121,-0.007743049,-0.014088375,0.11601763,-0.004149785,0.009066635,-0.00092238456,-0.0035618995,0.010631614,0.013780987,-0.0103848055,0.012250433,-0.009249184,-0.01249199,-0.0029679819,-0.0008968664,0.012890286,-0.009216546,0.0040419954,-0.015862962,-0.00816977,-0.009487874,-0.009800547,-0.0048554656,0.008405672,0.017592136,0.022855742,-0.015445725,0.019513894,-0.034476113,0.019545851,0.00024687152,-0.006499849,-0.012681782,-0.033870112,-0.012595794,-0.037728276,0.0011244338,0.03240444,0.03100769,-0.018120544,0.0026349027,-0.20876747,-0.0086171245,0.036619972,-0.017289685,0.005290288,-0.014397501,-0.018417407,-0.026200067,0.029971598,-0.0141794495,-0.022029579,0.0041440944,0.015822828,0.0050596558,0.021863079,-0.010124761,-0.0013585743,0.03490566,-0.0003520471,0.007838584,-0.015289511,-0.015783424,-0.0034373868,0.005863335,-0.0005247814,-0.011733705,0.02936815,-0.0015028864,-2.3386157e-5,-0.0069569764,-0.014097198,0.014227404,-0.00079441775,-0.011309632,-0.002511049,-0.008034794,0.020287704,-0.0033282377,-0.008737763,0.013316805,-0.03226772,-0.0065